    end
    
    %% Core Services Layer  
    subgraph CoreServices["⚡ Core Services"]
        DirectVector["DirectVectorService<br/>📁 services/direct_vector_service.rs<br/>🎯 40-60% Latency Reduction<br/>🔧 Direct Memtable Access"]
